---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout wide hero title="Speaking" path="/speaking" description="Joe Neiman speaks about entrepreneurship, recognizing opportunity, and building a business without wrecking your health. Fireside chats preferred.">
  <div class="hero-full page-hero full-bleed">
    <img src={url('/assets/photos/43north-win.jpg')} alt="The ACV team celebrating on stage at 43North" width="920" height="627" loading="eager" style="object-position: center 35%;" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"><span class="eyebrow">Joe Neiman</span><h1>Speaking</h1></div>
  </div>

  <section class="chapter prose" data-rise>
    <p class="lede">
      I've been telling these stories for years on podcasts and panels, from
      Startup Grind Buffalo to NEXT with Michael Sonnenfeldt. The stories are the
      whole talk: the driveway, the dealership, ACV, DealerClub, the health
      battle, and the flying.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter prose" data-rise>
    <h2>What I talk about</h2>
    <ul class="list-ruled">
      <li>Recognizing opportunity, and having the confidence to go after it.</li>
      <li>Building and scaling companies, from a yellow legal pad to a $5 billion IPO, including the mistakes.</li>
      <li>Stress, health, and building a business without putting the rest of your life on hold.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="chapter prose" data-rise>
    <h2>Where I've done this</h2>
    <ul class="list-ruled">
      <li>Startup Grind Buffalo, fireside chat on building ACV.</li>
      <li>43North's Latitude podcast, taped live in Buffalo.</li>
      <li>Industry panels, including Used Carpalooza.</li>
      <li>NEXT with Michael Sonnenfeldt, on stress, meditation, and reinvention.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- closer: format + the ask -->
  <section class="band band-light closer-band full-bleed" data-rise>
    <div class="band-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Format</span>
      <p>
        Fireside chats and moderated conversations are where I'm best. I don't
        bring a canned deck or a scripted talk, and the sessions that work best
        are the ones where the room comes with real questions and we just have an
        honest conversation.
      </p>
      <a class="cta cta-blue" href={url('/contact')}>Book a conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
